&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://millennium-whoop.github.io/aetherway/abdoopts/001/"&gt;Millennium Whoop&lt;/a&gt;, the iconic DJ of &lt;a href="https://millennium-whoop.github.io/aetherway/space-dvd/"&gt;Space DVD&lt;/a&gt;, is adored by fans across the &lt;em&gt;Aetherway&lt;/em&gt;. She is known for her love of &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href="https://millennium-whoop.github.io/aetherway/abdoopts/003/"&gt;Madame Astra’s&lt;/a&gt; Nebula Cupcakes&lt;/em&gt; and her dream of becoming &lt;em&gt;President of the Galaxy&lt;/em&gt;. Her fanbase is growing so fast that one planet even ran out of resources while producing her merch. Her catchphrase, &lt;em&gt;“No sad, only zoom-zoom smiles,”&lt;/em&gt; has reached mantra status in &lt;em&gt;Interdimensional Speech&lt;/em&gt; and likely means “no sadness, only in-between smiles.”&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>